{"data": [{"author_id": "2113552859514155008", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:15:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115296254817181769"], "id": "2115296254817181769", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Just in — ASM International (not ASML) official Q3:\n\nRecord €1.159B rev (+44% CC), GM 52%. Q4 guide €1.23B ±5%.\n\n2027 outlook &gt;€5.7B — hitting the 2030 target from their 2025 Investor Day, 3yrs early.\n\nYeah the mix is the tell: advanced logic/foundry led (first solid 1.4nm", "url": "https://x.com/Serenity_Re0/status/2115296254817181769"}, {"author_id": "1988454162057826304", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845602584612891"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SkRV6CJubp", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2114845602584612891/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114845470950662145", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/SkRV6CJubp"}]}, "id": "2114845602584612891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 766, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "TSMC REPORTEDLY EYES UP TO 20% CoWoS PRICE HIKE AS AI CHIP DEMAND SURGES (TW MEDIA)\n\nTSMC is reportedly considering another round of CoWoS price increases of up to 20%, as demand for advanced packaging continues to outpace available capacity.\n\nSupply-chain sources say customers https://t.co/SkRV6CJubp", "url": "https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2114845602584612891"}, {"author_id": "301460017", "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:46:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115168319385014525"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 62, "start": 57, "tag": "NVDA"}, {"end": 100, "start": 95, "tag": "SKHY"}, {"end": 131, "start": 127, "tag": "TSM"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 232, "start": 229, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 238, "start": 233, "tag": "TSMC"}, {"end": 247, "start": 239, "tag": "SKHynix"}, {"end": 255, "start": 248, "tag": "Nvidia"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/quVZq10v3o", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/takayanagiissei/status/2115168319385014525/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115168030489821184", "start": 256, "url": "https://t.co/quVZq10v3o"}]}, "id": "2115168319385014525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 266, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "L’IA est un écosystème, pas un simple pari sur les GPU.\n\n$NVDA fournit la puissance de calcul.\n$SKHY développe la mémoire HBM.\n$TSM apporte le packaging avancé CoWoS.\nLa validation HBM5 illustre leur interdépendance croissante.\n\n#AI #TSMC #SKHynix #Nvidia https://t.co/quVZq10v3o", "url": "https://x.com/takayanagiissei/status/2115168319385014525"}, {"author_id": "2078439826756698112", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:45:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115334015922352211"], "id": "2115334015922352211", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly preparing a new round of CoWoS price increases of up to 20%, Taiwan's Commercial Times reports, citing supply chain sources. Not a company announcement.\n\nPer the report:\n- Foundries and OSATs are weighing CoWoS hikes of 10% to 20%\n- Packaging equipment lead", "url": "https://x.com/finpostmd/status/2115334015922352211"}, {"author_id": "20020339", "created_at": "2026-10-27T09:43:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115016549400522868"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2115016549400522868", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM with 95% Upside ⬆️\n\n•Semiconductor giant TSMC will reportedly raise prices for its advanced chip packaging services by as much as 20%\n•TSMC’s CoWoS monthly capacity is expected to exceed 130,000 wafers in 2026 and reach 200,000 in 2027, according to analyst estimates", "url": "https://x.com/GetRichStayRich/status/2115016549400522868"}, {"author_id": "1468091726640611330", "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:37:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114909428839584067"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "法人估台積電先進封裝擴產與技術時程AI晶片搶產能，先進封裝醞釀漲價。供應鏈透露，台積電CoWoS報價醞釀新一波調漲，漲幅上看2成，部分封裝交期已拉長，產能吃緊壓力持續升高。搶產能效應同步延燒設備端，業者直言，客戶已無暇砍價，只要能承諾交期便下單，設備交期最長拉至八個月，供應鏈全面拚交貨、拚擴產。 先...", "display_url": "ctee.com.tw/news/202610277…", "end": 74, "expanded_url": "https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20261027700053-439901", "images": [{"height": 682, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114797112596606977/uAmJ88w4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114797112596606977/uAmJ88w4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 51, "status": 200, "title": "台積CoWoS傳喊漲上看2成", "unwound_url": "https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20261027700053-439901", "url": "https://t.co/2S9pvdyg8e"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/brYchmsx51", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/1pick____/status/2114909428839584067/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114909422241845249", "start": 205, "url": "https://t.co/brYchmsx51"}, {"display_url": "x.com/1pick____/stat…", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/1pick____/status/2107770248476926322", "start": 229, "url": "https://t.co/BN7a2bUcaL"}]}, "id": "2114909428839584067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2107770248476926322", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "💻 TSMC, CoWoS 패키징 가격 최대 20% 인상 추진…AI 반도체 공급 부족 심화\n\nhttps://t.co/2S9pvdyg8e\n\n📌 CoWoS 가격 10~20% 인상 가능성\nAI GPU뿐 아니라 서버 CPU, 맞춤형 ASIC까지 첨단 패키징 수요 확대\n\nTSMC 및 OSAT 업체들, CoWoS 가격 10~20% 인상 검토\n\n패키징·테스트 병목 심화로 공급자 https://t.co/brYchmsx51 https://t.co/BN7a2bUcaL", "url": "https://x.com/1pick____/status/2114909428839584067"}, {"author_id": "1480746975435771905", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:32:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114968452435984887"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Wi8MU2YKtc", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MojoTricks/status/2114968452435984887/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114968438041182208", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/Wi8MU2YKtc"}]}, "id": "2114968452435984887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 432, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly preparing to raise prices for its CoWoS advanced packaging services by as much as 20%, according to Taiwanese media reports. \n\nThe technology is critical for high-performance AI chips, connecting GPUs or other processors with high-bandwidth memory (HBM). https://t.co/Wi8MU2YKtc", "url": "https://x.com/MojoTricks/status/2114968452435984887"}, {"author_id": "1924330034535493632", "created_at": "2026-10-28T16:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115485493903425864"], "id": "2115485493903425864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly weighing a 10–20% hike for CoWoS packaging — the glue binding AI chips to HBM. Demand is no longer just GPUs: server CPUs and custom ASICs want in too, and equipment lead times are now 6–8 months. Packaging is the new bottleneck. (reportedly, Commercial Times)", "url": "https://x.com/Novaris12138/status/2115485493903425864"}, {"author_id": "1878424909476761600", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:59:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115428239770583375"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AYoLbhsG9G", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2115428239770583375/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115428196661571584", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/AYoLbhsG9G"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AYoLbhsG9G", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2115428239770583375/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115428196753817600", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/AYoLbhsG9G"}]}, "id": "2115428239770583375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS-R puts a logic chip and HBM side by side on an RDL interposer made of polymer and copper traces. Tech Daily | No. 10 of 16\n\nTSMC's website lists a minimum RDL line width/spacing of 2/2 µm. A 2025 ECTC TSMC paper reports 1.4/1.4 µm, finer than that 2/2 µm. More in reply. https://t.co/AYoLbhsG9G", "url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2115428239770583375"}, {"author_id": "499022116", "created_at": "2026-10-27T18:57:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115156029675880762"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/D9A62rkeG3", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/abnabdullah5/status/2115156029675880762/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115156015318532096", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/D9A62rkeG3"}]}, "id": "2115156029675880762", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 546, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "تدرس شركة تي إس إم سي رفع أسعار تقنية التغليف المتقدمة CoWoS بنسبة قد تصل إلى 20%، في ظل الطلب المتسارع على معالجات الذكاء الاصطناعي والدوائر المتخصصة ASIC، وهو ما يضع ضغوطًا متزايدة على قدرات الإنتاج وسلاسل التوريد. وتشير تقارير إلى أن تعقيد تصميم الرقائق الحديثة ودمج المزيد من https://t.co/D9A62rkeG3", "url": "https://x.com/abnabdullah5/status/2115156029675880762"}, {"author_id": "148936861", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114930088114360655"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "반도체"}, {"end": 50, "start": 44, "tag": "반도체장비"}, {"end": 56, "start": 51, "tag": "ASML"}, {"end": 62, "start": 57, "tag": "네덜란드"}, {"end": 68, "start": 63, "tag": "노광장비"}, {"end": 74, "start": 69, "tag": "삼성전자"}, {"end": 82, "start": 75, "tag": "SK하이닉스"}, {"end": 88, "start": 83, "tag": "TSMC"}, {"end": 93, "start": 89, "tag": "HBM"}, {"end": 100, "start": 94, "tag": "반도체패권"}], "urls": [{"description": "인공지능(AI) 반도체 수요가 급증하면서 네덜란드 반도체 장비업체 ASML의 경제적 영향력이 커지고 있다. 올해 ASML이 네덜란드 경제에서 직접 차지하는 비중은 1.6%에 이를 것으로 전망된다. 반도체 장비업체 한 곳에 국가 경제가 지나치게 의존할 수 있다는 우려도 나온다.26일(현", "display_url": "it.chosun.com/news/articleVi…", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://it.chosun.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=2023092172845&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=sns&utm_campaign=itchosun", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114930108670603264/rEnYYLiL?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 589}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114930108670603264/rEnYYLiL?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 102, "status": 200, "title": "네덜란드 경제 1.6% 차지한 ASML", "unwound_url": "https://it.chosun.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=2023092172845&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=sns&utm_campaign=itchosun", "url": "https://t.co/IRkF7S1CN4"}]}, "id": "2114930088114360655", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#반도체 장비업체 한 곳에 국가 경제가 지나치게 의존할 수 있다는 우려 나와\n\n#반도체장비 #ASML #네덜란드 #노광장비 #삼성전자 #SK하이닉스 #TSMC #HBM #반도체패권\n\nhttps://t.co/IRkF7S1CN4", "url": "https://x.com/IT_CHOSUN/status/2114930088114360655"}, {"author_id": "1336521079494303744", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:30:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114937837678383462"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 116, "start": 112, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/q810IbIteA", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/babybluecream/status/2114937837678383462/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114937828656504832", "start": 180, "url": "https://t.co/q810IbIteA"}]}, "id": "2114937837678383462", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1120, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC가 첨단 패키징 가격을 최대 20% 올린다는 보도, 왜 나왔을까 ㅣ 261027\n\n1. AI 반도체 수요가 첨단 패키징 공급을 넘어섰기 때문임.\n\n대만 상업시보는 업계 소식통을 인용해 TSMC $TSM 이 첨단 패키징 가격을 최대 20% 올릴 것으로 보인다고 보도함.\n\nTSMC는 공식 입장을 내놓지 않았고, 적용 https://t.co/q810IbIteA", "url": "https://x.com/babybluecream/status/2114937837678383462"}, {"author_id": "1280587925336530948", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:32:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114862712672882949"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 13, "start": 9, "tag": "AMD"}, {"end": 20, "start": 16, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zK6NIHdibc", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MikeLongTerm/status/2114862712672882949/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114862698886320128", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/zK6NIHdibc"}, {"display_url": "x.com/MikeLongTerm/s…", "end": 322, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MikeLongTerm/status/2114756932061774234", "start": 299, "url": "https://t.co/xDsZskcFk3"}]}, "id": "2114862712672882949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2647, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114756932061774234", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "BREAKING $AMD | $TSM CoWoS advanced packaging prices are reportedly set to rise by up to 20% amid tight capacity driven by surging AI demand.\n\nZhang Jiarui in Taiwan’s Commercial Times, reports that TSMC is preparing another round of CoWoS (Chip-on-Wafer-on-Substrate) price https://t.co/zK6NIHdibc https://t.co/xDsZskcFk3", "url": "https://x.com/MikeLongTerm/status/2114862712672882949"}, {"author_id": "2067640128105824256", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:00:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114930107706146978"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}, {"end": 255, "start": 250, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gFJIUcQLYC", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MelvinInvests/status/2114930107706146978/photo/1", "me